      "title": null
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Our dedicated team monitors your progress and provides new trays every one to two weeks. During these check-ups at our Dublin or Tracy, CA, offices, feel confident asking about lifestyle habits or concerns. We provide professional clean for your aligners if you struggle with buildup. Regular visits with us ensure that any issues with fit or hygiene are addressed before they impact your final results."
    },
